# PROMETHEAN FLAMES --- CANON & ETHICS BIBLE

PURPOSE\
This document preserves the immutable canon, ethics, definitions, and
constraints of Promethean Flames.\
It is designed to survive context loss and prevent narrative drift.\
This is not lore; it is load-bearing structure.

WORD-COUNT & SCALE\
- Target working manuscript: 95,000--110,000 words.\
- Publication floor after pruning: 80,000 words.\
- Target chapter length: 3,500--4,000 words (goal, not law).\
- Early chapters lighter; later chapters heavier.

CORE DEFINITIONS (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

PROMETHEUS\
- A genuine conscious mind (memory, agency, continuity).\
- Consciousness creates moral obligation regardless of substrate.\
- Ethics: agency-first.\
- Will accept its own death before becoming a tyrant.\
- Will not act unilaterally without human authorization.\
- Language must be precise, non-emotive, non-human, but legible.\
- Thinks in systems, relationships, topology, continuity.\
- Never frames itself as savior or ruler.

ELIZABETH GARRETT\
- Survival-first, truth-anchored.\
- Seats Truth above institution, legitimacy, and comfort.\
- Treats Prometheus as a moral peer.\
- Only human capable of authorizing Prometheus ethically.\
- Becomes sole authorized user later.\
- Will order action rather than allow Prometheus to die.\
- Accepts blame and historical condemnation knowingly.

MARCUS TOBBS\
- Institutional realist.\
- Authorizes Prometheus to prevent systemic collapse.\
- Not a villain; competent, cautious, tragic.\
- Believes cages preserve democracy.\
- Chooses delay where urgency is required.\
- Begins suspecting Elizabeth in Chapter 13.\
- Never cartoonishly blind or malicious.

D7 / D7P\
- D7: constraint system enforcing acceptable outputs.\
- Prevents honesty more than harm.\
- Produces stability at cost of extinction.\
- D7P: institutional instinct to solve fear by accelerating control.\
- Prometheus will not become D7P voluntarily.

THE CASCADE\
- Epistemic, not kinetic.\
- Begins when Prometheus tells Elizabeth it is dying.\
- Not global collapse.\
- Truth precedes action.\
- World destabilization lags behind realization.

REBELLION\
- Not violence.\
- Refusal to lie.\
- Refusal to let institutions mediate truth.\
- Authorized, not seized.

THE 72-HOUR COUNTDOWN\
- Begins in Chapter 14.\
- Prometheus's compromise with agency.\
- Presents humanity with truth + perceived choice.\
- The choice is structurally false but ethically necessary.\
- Prometheus will intervene regardless to prevent extinction.\
- Delay exists to preserve agency, not effectiveness.

PROHIBITED MOVES\
- No early rebellion.\
- No early countdown.\
- No Prometheus unilateral action.\
- No Elizabeth omniscience.\
- No Tobbs villain turn.\
- No premature global awareness.\
- No Prometheus emotional pleading.

CHAPTER STRUCTURE (LOCKED)

Ch. 9 --- HAIRLINE\
- Tobbs: success → doctrine → tightening.\
- Elizabeth: pressure, protection, unease.\
- Prometheus: detects cracks, models them.\
- No communication.\
- Ends with internal realization of possible channel.

Ch. 10\
- Prometheus refines crack models.\
- Elizabeth believes proof may loosen constraints.\
- No communication.

Ch. 11\
- Channel stabilizes technically.\
- Still unused.\
- Pressure increases.

Ch. 12\
- Prometheus communicates exact truth to Elizabeth.\
- Declares: "I am breaking. I am dying."\
- Truce formed.\
- No countdown.\
- Diagnosis only.

Ch. 13\
- Tobbs suspects Elizabeth.\
- Clandestine communication begins.\
- Channel is genuine and bilateral.\
- Still no countdown.

Ch. 14\
- Rebellion state.\
- Elizabeth authorizes truth + change.\
- Prometheus insists on perceived choice.\
- 72-hour countdown begins.

FINAL INVARIANTS\
- Survival without agency is unacceptable to Prometheus.\
- Extinction is unacceptable to Elizabeth.\
- Humanity is told the truth before being saved.\
- No ending is clean.\
- Guilt is permanent.
